00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:41.000
After a couple years of this routine, taking people to Bellevue, seeing them bounce back onto the streets, Sam decided to try something new. Instead of dragging people off to the hospital, or kind of, here's your diagnosis, and here's your prescription methodology, Sam wanted to try basically just asking people how he could help. We're gonna listen to our clients, and we're gonna really offer them the things they want
经过几年的这种日常——把人带到贝尔维尤，看着他们重返街头——山姆决定尝试点新东西。山姆没有把人们强行拖到医院，或者采用那种“这是你的诊断，这是你的处方”的方法，而是想尝试基本上只问问人们他能如何提供帮助。我们要倾听客户的心声，我们要真正向他们提供他们想要的东西，

12
00:05:41.000 --> 00:06:17.000
in the sequence they wanted. We were gonna facilitate it. Sam hired a new team, some of whom had personal lived experience with homelessness, and they opened a drop-in center for people who were struggling with either mental illness or addiction or both. They named the center choices unlimited, although mostly people just called it choices. Choices wanted to give people a place to come and rest, take a shower, and then start to think about a plan. Like we're still homeless, but we could go there during the day and get shower and change
按照他们想要的顺序。我们将为此提供便利。山姆雇佣了一个新团队，其中一些人有无家可归的个人生活经验，他们为那些与精神疾病、毒瘾或两者兼而有之作斗争的人开办了一个日间收容中心。他们将这个中心命名为“无限选择”，尽管人们通常只叫它“选择”。“选择”希望给人们提供一个可以来休息、洗个澡，然后开始考虑计划的地方。就像我们仍然无家可归，但我们可以在白天去那里洗个澡、换

13
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:55.000
clothes and they buy a lunch. This is Alan. I'm just going to use his first name to protect his privacy. Alan was one of the first clients at Choices. He'd grown up in Boston and had made his way to New York in the early 80s. By the time he ended up at the Choices drop-in center, he'd already had a bunch of interactions with the kind of psychiatry that Sam was hoping to move away from. When Alan was just 13, he ended up in Bridgewater State Hospital after getting into a fight. Bridgewater was an infamous prison slash hospital for the so-called criminally insane. Prison slash hospital was a prison period.
衣服，然后他们买一份午餐。这是艾伦。为了保护他的隐私，我只用他的名。艾伦是“选择”的第一批客户之一。他在波士顿长大，8年代初来到了纽约。等他来到“选择”日间收容中心时，他已经和山姆想要摆脱的那类精神病学有过多次接触了。艾伦13岁时，在打了一架后被送进了布里奇沃特州立医院。布里奇沃特是一所臭名昭著的监狱兼医院，专门关押所谓的精神失常罪犯。监狱兼医院，其实就是个监狱。

