They just called it a hospital. That was a torture chamber. That's what it was. I turned 14 and wanted to sell. Alan told me that abuse from his mother and mistreatment from all kinds of authority figures had left him full of rage that he couldn't always control. I got to a point where I wasn't taking no shit from nobody.
他们只是管它叫医院。那是个刑讯室。事实就是这样。我14岁时就想卖东西。艾伦告诉我，母亲的虐待和各种权威人士的虐待让他充满了他无法总是控制的愤怒。我到了那种谁的屁话也不听的地步。

