Oh yeah, I used to fight a lot. I do got a short temper when it comes to a bunch of bull crap. He would come into my office like, you're the dogs, if they ever do this to me, I'm gonna kill them, you know, like this. And I'm like, Alan, you can't actually say these things. It's a mental health program. Like, people are gonna come and lock you up,
哦，是的，我以前经常打架。遇到一堆废话的时候，我的脾气确实很急。他会走进我的办公室说，你们这群混蛋，如果他们敢这么对我的话，我要宰了他们，你知道的，就像这样。我说，艾伦，你不能真的说这些话。这是一个心理健康项目。听着，人们会来把你关起来，

