you know, like, you gotta watch your language, you know. For Alan, it was anger, but all the clients at choices were dealing with some kind of mental health issue. Things like bipolar disorder and schizophrenia. These clients didn't trust the choices other people made for them, but maybe they would trust their own. Sam's job was just to help make it happen. You want a drug rehab program? We'll help you find one and enroll. You want to get on meds? We'll get you connected to the right doctors.
你知道的，所以你得注意你的言辞，你知道的。对艾伦来说，那是愤怒，但“选择”的所有客户都在处理某种心理健康问题。比如双相情感障碍和精神分裂症。这些客户不信任别人为他们做出的选择，但也许他们会信任他们自己的。山姆的工作就是帮助实现这一点。你想要一个戒毒项目？我们会帮你找一个并协助你注册。你想吃药？我们会帮你联系合适的医生。

