This approach would come to be known as housing first, but back then it was just a wild idea they were trying out. You know, the people we were going to house, when you met them, they didn't inspire confidence that it would all work out okay. Sam and his colleagues secured money from the state office of mental health services to pay for this experiment.
这种方法后来被称为“住房优先”，但在当时这只是他们正在尝试的一个疯狂想法。你知道的，我们要安置的人，当你见到他们时，他们并不能激起人们对一切都会顺利解决的信心。山姆和他的同事们从州心理健康服务办公室获得了资金来支付这项实验。

