housing first model. One of the first was George W. Bush, who helped launch several housing first style programs across the country. Fast forward a few more years and HUD, which gives a lot of money to nonprofits that work with the homeless. They're actually evaluating grant applications on how housing firstee the applications are. Sam Simberis and his colleagues and all the clients at Pathways, they had flipped the script completely. And these days most people at HUD, Ben Carson, notwithstanding, don't talk about folks being housing ready anymore. Now there's an understanding. People were always ready to be housed. Allen and Camar were ready, even though they had stumbled a little at first.
“住房优先”模式。最早的一位是乔治·W·布什，他在全国各地帮助启动了好几个“住房优先”风格的项目。快进几年，美国住房和城市发展部（HUD）向与无家可归者合作的非营利组织提供大量资金，他们实际上在根据申请的“住房优先”程度来评估拨款申请。山姆·森贝里斯和他的同事们以及“通往住房之路”的所有客户，他们彻底颠覆了剧本。如今，HUD的大多数人——抛开本·卡森不谈——不再谈论人们是否具备“住房准备度”了。现在大家达成了一种共识。人们随时准备好入住住房。艾伦和卡马尔已经准备好了，尽管他们一开始有点磕磕绊绊。

